<h2>FAQs</h2>
<details><summary>Will a trip coordinator accompany the group?</summary><p>On-ground accompaniment can be discussed and confirmed for the selected itinerary.</p></details>
<details><summary>Do you handle school and college trips?</summary><p>Yes. Itineraries and trip coordination can be planned with the institution. Student supervision and parent communication responsibilities are agreed in advance.</p></details>
<details><summary>Can you plan trips for international guests?</summary><p>Yes. Guide support, transfers and accommodation options can be discussed and confirmed through selected travel partners.</p></details>
<details><summary>Do you plan corporate trips?</summary><p>Yes: team outings, offsites and incentive trips with one point of contact.</p></details>
<details><summary>How do I get a price?</summary><p>Send the enquiry form with group size, dates and places. We reply with a quote.</p></details>
</div></section>
